leanne_sales: FYI Aurora kickoff tomorrow. POC asks: streaming SDK, model-initiated sync webhook calls (model waits for webhook), strict invoice JSON at the edge, SOC2 + customer KMS, and fixed egress IPs / VPC option. Can someone bring a tiny SDK snippet and a 1-page runbook for the demo?

kyle_dev: Peak ~65 QPS, ~100 tokens/resp, tool calls ~1/5 responses, single-shot. p50 <120ms, p95 <320ms.

erin_solutions: I'll do pricing. Quick note: Hosted = per-token; Dedicated = committed cluster. Recommend baseline Dedicated + hosted burst. Sending ballpark DM after lunch.

jess_infra: Security notes: customer-managed KMS supported (needs onboarding), IP allowlist requires Private or Dedicated w/ VPC peering and static egress. SOC2 PDF available, will drop in deal folder. For sync webhooks set client timeout ~1500-2000ms and circuit breaker.

kyle_dev: Tiny Node pseudo-snippet for demo:
```js
// pseudo demo
const rw = new Redwood({ apiKey: process.env.RW_KEY, routing: 'dedicated' });
const s = rw.stream({ model: 'redwood-rtf-1', functions: [INVOICE_FN] });
s.on('data', d => process.stdout.write(d.text || ''))
s.on('function_call', async call => {
  const res = await fetch(call.webhook, { method: 'POST', body: JSON.stringify(call.args), timeout: 1500 });
  const j = await res.json();
  s.resumeWithFunctionResult(j);
});
```

kyle_dev: Edge schema (enforce): top-level "invoice" with invoice_id:string, total_cents:number, currency:string, line_items: array of {desc:string, qty:number, unit_cents:number}. If mismatch -> mark invalid and route to verification flow.

erin_solutions: I'll DM numbers (hybrid quote). Finance will need expected commit term to firm Dedicated pricing.

